 "description": "<p>The cheongsam is the loudest quiet garment in costume lingerie: a closed collar up top and a high slit waiting below. This retro-cut version is sewn from polyester in two colorways, white and black, with the slit placed to open as you walk rather than as you stand.</p>\n<p>Three sizes cover the range. S suits 85-105 lbs, M suits 105-120 lbs, and L suits 120-140 lbs, so pick by weight before anything else - the waist seam is where a wrong size shows first.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester</li>\n<li>Item type: cheongsam dress</li>\n<li>Features: high slits, retro oriental cut</li>\n<li>Color: white or black</li>\n<li>Sizing: S / M / L by weight, 85-140 lbs</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Wear it with flats for a dinner-costume evening or with heels when the slit should do the talking. Either way the silhouette stays unmistakable.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Retro oriental cheongsam in white or black with high slits, sized S to L by weight from 85 to 140 lbs.</p>\n",
